    "body": "See https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2009Aug/0807.html for some more data and reasoning around this. I believe those two examples are intentionally not allowed because at the time nobody used them and software would typically reject them as invalid, so it was considered more useful to treat them as invalid in HTML also.\n\nDo you have examples of people using such addresses?\n",
